// mark.vtest <name>: barrier + log marker. The checkpoint is queued behind every earlier command and
// the script blocks until it runs, so (a) all earlier commands have executed, (b) it is logged as
// "TESTSCRIPT: CheckPoint -> '<name>'". A bare Test_Checkpoint is DROPPED if it lands during Test_Wait.
Test_Checkpoint $1
Test_WaitForCheckPoint $1
